{"nodes": [{"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_gas_daytime_flock_frame", "label": "Gas-Channel Daytime Flock Frame (2022-02-23 11:01:28)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01501.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Overhead colour daytime frame, '1080P-IPC-Gas', '2022-02-23 11:01:28'. Young pale chicks form loose patches over bare litter around four pan feeders; a brooder/heater hood is partly visible at the right edge, indicating an early rearing stage."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_daytime_color_imaging", "label": "Daytime Colour Imaging Condition", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01501.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only mid-morning frame in the chunk; ambient light gives full colour, warmer litter tone and softer shadows than the artificially lit night frames. Including it makes the test set span the diurnal illumination range the deployed model will face."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_early_growth_stage_flock", "label": "Early Growth-Stage Flock (Small Birds, Low Density)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01501.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Birds occupy only a fraction of the pixel area of the March frames and leave large bare-litter regions. Apparent object scale therefore varies several-fold across the test set purely from bird age, which is a scale-generalisation requirement for the detector."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_flock_growth_progression", "label": "Flock Growth Progression Across the Production Cycle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01501.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordering the chunk by burned-in date (23 Feb, 24 Feb, 01 Mar, 14 Mar) traces bird size increasing and free floor area shrinking from sparse chicks to a wall-to-wall carpet, i.e. the frames sample one rearing cycle rather than independent scenes."}], "edges": [{"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_gas_daytime_flock_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01201_1_1_gas_camera_channel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01501.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_gas_daytime_flock_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_daytime_color_imaging", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01501.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_gas_daytime_flock_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01501_early_growth_stage_flock", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-mai